# Default Flatpaks. flatpak preinstall installs what's declared here and also
# removes apps an earlier OS preinstalled that aren't listed. Uninstalling one
# of these opts out. Run at boot by aerinite-flatpak-preinstall.service.

[Flatpak Preinstall org.mozilla.firefox]
Branch=stable

[Flatpak Preinstall io.github.kolunmi.Bazaar]
Branch=stable
